WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:03.300
[Wind, and a low hum.]

00:10.000 --> 00:13.300
[Water trickles. Soft music begins.]

00:14.167 --> 00:19.167
Give a little. It gives back more.

00:25.833 --> 00:29.167
New material: clay.

00:35.833 --> 00:39.167
New life: reeds. [A bird sings.]

00:41.667 --> 00:44.500
[Crickets.]

00:50.000 --> 00:53.333
All of this, from one seed.

00:57.500 --> 01:00.000
Every afternoon leaves a layer.
